# Keep the sandbox image context explicit. In particular, a developer's local
# virtual environment must never overwrite the frozen environment built in the
# Dockerfile, and local configuration must never be copied into an image layer.
**

!.dockerignore
!Dockerfile
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!supervisord.conf
!README.md
!README_zh.md

!app/
!app/**
!scripts/
!scripts/**
!resource/
!resource/**

# Defense in depth for files re-included by the runtime directory rules above.
.venv/
**/.venv/
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.coverage
**/.coverage.*
**/htmlcov/
**/.cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
tests/
**/tests/
